/// requires: db
/// known-gap: vm db_* builtins are not in the VM builtin table
/// known-gap: interp numeric is not decoded (sql_cell_to_value falls through to nil), so a non-NULL value reads as nil
/// A non-NULL numeric column does not read as nil (its exact Goblin type is not pinned down here).
r | :db_query_one("SELECT 12.34::numeric(10,2) AS n", [])
say(:is_nil(r["n"]))
